      "content": "thanks. that's a good start. i'm also seeing a lot of pushback from people saying we can't afford it or that it'll just kill motivation. it feels like those arguments are pretty outdated and don't really grasp the scale of what AI is doing to the economy. do you think those critiques are actually legitimate, or are they just being used to stall progress?",
